{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"2530d1c2587e8c143235d290f6798bef315fb01671141fa63121d5c11d922fc8","ja":"遊歩道に響く声","zh":"回荡在散步道上的声音","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6db511d3c688737ef7966848e8e6ed538ff619bb1c28a688e281fb07dbb86785","ja":"……？　なにか……誰かがケンカして\nいるような声、聞こえない？","zh":"……？　好像……有人在吵架\n的声音，你听不到吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d725a92982163be343d74ed630418ecd30583322cc4b52b452448e22c61de701","ja":"はい～。とってもハキハキした声です～。でも、\nケンカなのに声はひとりだけのような～……？","zh":"是的～。声音非常清脆～。但是，\n明明是在吵架，却好像只有一个人的声音～……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"edf72ceba43612cd55434b0e72366d7b0a8b225c1613e9af730720fc5b2133a9","ja":"この声、聞き覚えがある気がするわ。\nあら？　あそこにいるのは……未来ちゃん？","zh":"这个声音，我感觉好像听过。\n哎呀？那边的是……未来？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e4e178636b2c41b1697f3297ebd6baaf98cc818a2382cf2677a2005884182af4","ja":"「私たちがやっていることは犯罪……それはそう。\nたとえ貧しい人たちのためだとしても……」","zh":"“我们所做的是犯罪……确实如此。\n即使是为了穷苦的人们……”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"e6ba81380b4c6eab0ca1794b0e4157d42c0554028fa4934195caa6c5640072d5","ja":"「だけど、間違っているとは思わない。だから、\n私個人の意志として、あなたに背中を預けるわ」","zh":"\"但是，我并不认为这是错的。所以，\n以我个人的意志，我会把背后托付给你。\"","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"d83685be358be19ed9aaa4ef1ba702eef8d4c881fcd7b4609df45e83afcc3f6d","ja":"おや～、演技の練習でしたか～。\n精が出ますな～。","zh":"哎呀～，是在练习演技吗～。\n真卖力啊～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"b2441b61436809791fdf3fd79b4ac183e9a599d98221d002cd729d8f54c8fbae","ja":"そうね。……人通りのあるところで練習するには、\n向いてないセリフな気はするけど……。","zh":"也是呢。……要在人来人往的地方练习，\n总觉得这句台词不太合适……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a4ee8ae43132439ebfa5fe6ca4baba8437fdcb4add27202fc4b0fd8c8b748ccf","ja":"あのセリフは……スピンオフドラマかしら？\nDVDの、映像特典の……。","zh":"那句台词……是衍生剧里的吗？\nDVD的、影像特典里的……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"03635bb246039dedf1c4e9491c2b5ff49639f6846cb71574c0d11412df3aa442","ja":"そうみたいね。桃子と2人だけ、\n15分の短編とはいえ、ナナシが主役ですものね。","zh":"好像是这样呢。只有桃子和2人，\n虽然是15分钟的短篇，但七尾是主角呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"c9f2d58c40d013bd1551a0c9211b53b32d9cb3cdf5cbc9733d50c3ca8cb24b37","ja":"見えないところで、ちゃんと努力してるのね。\nえらいわ、未来ちゃん。","zh":"在看不见的地方也在好好努力呢。\n真了不起，小未来。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"1beb31e799ba5b251d3ca3a8f1c7c441d5af68aa22dc0f6892e2e66680cb0b88","ja":"歌織さん、伊織ちゃん。\n未来ちゃんに、何か差し入れをしませんか～？","zh":"歌织、伊织。\n要不要给未来带点吃的呢～？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"3a598927c11b3a7e96b1519af5e4f6769b5eeba33ea18aefa6f46079d435db26","ja":"ええ、そうね。\nレッスンは、まだまだ続くみたいだし……。","zh":"嗯，是啊。\n课程好像还要继续很久……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_937.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"3c86e886e8dad0ff62fedbbeed956d0cb0be72686b09540cd3db1aeafd5a9b1e","ja":"おいしいもの買ってきて、驚かせちゃいましょ♪\nあ、桃子の分もね！","zh":"去买点好吃的，给他们一个惊喜吧♪\n啊，还有桃子的份！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
